Package: INLFPM
Type: Package
Title: Max, Sum and Cauchy Tests for High-Dimensional Factor Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Long", "Feng", email = "flnankai@nankai.edu.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tests the joint null of zero intercepts in a panel of returns
    with observed factors. Implements least-squares, spatial-sign and
    inverse-norm weighted tests. The spatial-sign and inverse-norm maxima
    use finite-sample analytic reference tails, which also enter their
    Cauchy combinations. Includes a summary-only parallel simulation driver.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, parallel, utils
URL: https://github.com/flnankai/INLFPM
BugReports: https://github.com/flnankai/INLFPM/issues
